Item, eidem basilicae, centum libras prov. <NOTE N="(31)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="CCVI" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="CCVID"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Prov.</HI>  Sic in codice Vallicellano, per abbreviationem;
